{"kp_id": "jgy-022.kp0001", "video_id": "jgy-022", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "产后三病：中风（痉）、郁冒、大便难，因气血两虚；坐月子避风。", "entity_ids": [], "chapter_id": "jgy-022.c01", "evidence_quote": "有三个病", "seg_from": 2, "seg_to": 2, "start_s": 20.44, "end_s": 26.3, "citation": {"youtube_id": "1C6RSxE27YY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1C6RSxE27YY&t=20s", "series": "jgy", "episode": 22, "title": "倪海廈《金匱要略》細分版： 21婦人產後病", "start_s": 20.44, "end_s": 26.3}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "jgy-022.kp0002", "video_id": "jgy-022", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "产后大便难宜麻子仁丸润导，不可妄投大承气小承气。", "entity_ids": ["formula.ma_zi_ren_wan"], "chapter_id": "jgy-022.c01", "evidence_quote": "麻子仁丸", "seg_from": 17, "seg_to": 17, "start_s": 117.52, "end_s": 122.55, "citation": {"youtube_id": "1C6RSxE27YY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1C6RSxE27YY&t=117s", "series": "jgy", "episode": 22, "title": "倪海廈《金匱要略》細分版： 21婦人產後病", "start_s": 117.52, "end_s": 122.55}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "jgy-022.kp0003", "video_id": "jgy-022", "type": "formula_indication", "statement": "产后病多端难辨时，小柴胡汤和解为第一方，常可安情绪。", "entity_ids": ["formula.xiao_chai_hu_tang"], "chapter_id": "jgy-022.c01", "evidence_quote": "小柴胡汤好好", "seg_from": 25, "seg_to": 25, "start_s": 161.91, "end_s": 175.29, "citation": {"youtube_id": "1C6RSxE27YY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1C6RSxE27YY&t=161s", "series": "jgy", "episode": 22, "title": "倪海廈《金匱要略》細分版： 21婦人產後病", "start_s": 161.91, "end_s": 175.29}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "jgy-022.kp0004", "video_id": "jgy-022", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "产后郁冒脉微弱不能食、头汗出，为血虚阳浮；小柴胡汤主之。", "entity_ids": ["formula.xiao_chai_hu_tang"], "chapter_id": "jgy-022.c01", "evidence_quote": "脉微弱", "seg_from": 35, "seg_to": 35, "start_s": 209.76, "end_s": 217.775, "citation": {"youtube_id": "1C6RSxE27YY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1C6RSxE27YY&t=209s", "series": "jgy", "episode": 22, "title": "倪海廈《金匱要略》細分版： 21婦人產後病", "start_s": 209.76, "end_s": 217.78}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "jgy-022.kp0005", "video_id": "jgy-022", "type": "pathomechanism", "statement": "阳虚则毛孔不固阴出为汗；孤阳上出则头汗。", "entity_ids": [], "chapter_id": "jgy-022.c01", "evidence_quote": "汗流不止", "seg_from": 43, "seg_to": 43, "start_s": 259.49, "end_s": 264.07, "citation": {"youtube_id": "1C6RSxE27YY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1C6RSxE27YY&t=259s", "series": "jgy", "episode": 22, "title": "倪海廈《金匱要略》細分版： 21婦人產後病", "start_s": 259.49, "end_s": 264.07}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "jgy-022.kp0006", "video_id": "jgy-022", "type": "formula_indication", "statement": "小柴胡汤是产后孕妇第一方。", "entity_ids": ["formula.xiao_chai_hu_tang"], "chapter_id": "jgy-022.c01", "evidence_quote": "产后孕妇第一方", "seg_from": 61, "seg_to": 61, "start_s": 360.75, "end_s": 367.23, "citation": {"youtube_id": "1C6RSxE27YY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1C6RSxE27YY&t=360s", "series": "jgy", "episode": 22, "title": "倪海廈《金匱要略》細分版： 21婦人產後病", "start_s": 360.75, "end_s": 367.23}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "jgy-022.kp0007", "video_id": "jgy-022", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "产后血虚已复、能食而发热见阳明燥实，可用大承气汤。", "entity_ids": ["formula.da_cheng_qi_tang"], "chapter_id": "jgy-022.c01", "evidence_quote": "大承气汤", "seg_from": 69, "seg_to": 69, "start_s": 397.47, "end_s": 399.59, "citation": {"youtube_id": "1C6RSxE27YY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1C6RSxE27YY&t=397s", "series": "jgy", "episode": 22, "title": "倪海廈《金匱要略》細分版： 21婦人產後病", "start_s": 397.47, "end_s": 399.59}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "jgy-022.kp0008", "video_id": "jgy-022", "type": "formula_indication", "statement": "产后腹痛用当归生姜羊肉汤，兼治寒疝虚劳；羊肉为肉中之王温中补血。", "entity_ids": ["formula.dang_gui_sheng_jiang_yang_rou_tang", "herb.yang_rou"], "chapter_id": "jgy-022.c02", "evidence_quote": "当归生姜羊肉汤", "seg_from": 73, "seg_to": 73, "start_s": 409.25, "end_s": 415.97, "citation": {"youtube_id": "1C6RSxE27YY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1C6RSxE27YY&t=409s", "series": "jgy", "episode": 22, "title": "倪海廈《金匱要略》細分版： 21婦人產後病", "start_s": 409.25, "end_s": 415.97}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "jgy-022.kp0009", "video_id": "jgy-022", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "产后烦满不得卧，胞中浊物未尽，用枳实芍药散（等分）化脓亦可。", "entity_ids": ["herb.zhi_shi", "herb.shao_yao"], "chapter_id": "jgy-022.c02", "evidence_quote": "芍药", "seg_from": 84, "seg_to": 84, "start_s": 476.17, "end_s": 483.48, "citation": {"youtube_id": "1C6RSxE27YY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1C6RSxE27YY&t=476s", "series": "jgy", "episode": 22, "title": "倪海廈《金匱要略》細分版： 21婦人產後病", "start_s": 476.17, "end_s": 483.48}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "只是=枳实", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "jgy-022.kp0010", "video_id": "jgy-022", "type": "formula_indication", "statement": "枳实芍药散不效，示瘀血重，改下瘀血汤（大黄桃仁䗪虫等）。", "entity_ids": ["formula.xia_yu_xue_tang"], "chapter_id": "jgy-022.c02", "evidence_quote": "下淤血汤", "seg_from": 101, "seg_to": 101, "start_s": 594.58, "end_s": 596.875, "citation": {"youtube_id": "1C6RSxE27YY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1C6RSxE27YY&t=594s", "series": "jgy", "episode": 22, "title": "倪海廈《金匱要略》細分版： 21婦人產後病", "start_s": 594.58, "end_s": 596.88}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "jgy-022.kp0011", "video_id": "jgy-022", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "攻瘀可佐大黄桃仁；下焦阳虚寒凝瘀可先/兼附子温阳再化瘀。", "entity_ids": ["herb.fu_zi"], "chapter_id": "jgy-022.c02", "evidence_quote": "温下焦的阳", "seg_from": 118, "seg_to": 118, "start_s": 707.54, "end_s": 714.39, "citation": {"youtube_id": "1C6RSxE27YY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1C6RSxE27YY&t=707s", "series": "jgy", "episode": 22, "title": "倪海廈《金匱要略》細分版： 21婦人產後病", "start_s": 707.54, "end_s": 714.39}, "confidence": 0.85, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "jgy-022.kp0012", "video_id": "jgy-022", "type": "clinical_tip", "statement": "产后七八日少腹坚痛恶露不尽、不大便烦躁发热实脉，黄昏倍烦为大承气证。", "entity_ids": ["formula.da_cheng_qi_tang"], "chapter_id": "jgy-022.c02", "evidence_quote": "大承气汤增", "seg_from": 139, "seg_to": 139, "start_s": 819.62, "end_s": 828.605, "citation": {"youtube_id": "1C6RSxE27YY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1C6RSxE27YY&t=819s", "series": "jgy", "episode": 22, "title": "倪海廈《金匱要略》細分版： 21婦人產後病", "start_s": 819.62, "end_s": 828.61}, "confidence": 0.9, "asr_note": "增=证", "source": "llm_read"}
{"kp_id": "jgy-022.kp0013", "video_id": "jgy-022", "type": "formula_indication", "statement": "产后风数十日不解，头微痛恶寒发热干呕汗出，用阳旦汤即桂枝汤加肉桂。", "entity_ids": ["formula.gui_zhi_tang", "new.herb.rou_gui"], "chapter_id": "jgy-022.c03", "evidence_quote": "桂枝汤", "seg_from": 176, "seg_to": 176, "start_s": 1015.81, "end_s": 1019.295, "citation": {"youtube_id": "1C6RSxE27YY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=1C6RSxE27YY&t=1015s", "series": "jgy", "episode": 22, "title": "倪海廈《金匱要略》細分版： 21婦人產後病", "start_s": 1015.81, "end_s": 1019.29}, "confidence": 0.95, "asr_note": "", "source": "llm_read"}
